sentences.text:
In the facts and circumstances of the case, applicant-Bhag Singh, aged about 61 years, is directed to be released on Interim Anticipatory Bail, in the event of his arrest, on furnishing his personal bond of Rs.30,000/- and two reliable sureties, each in the like amount, with the following conditions :-
(i) Applicant shall attend the Trial court regularly and he shall not seek any unnecessary adjournment;
(ii) Applicant shall not directly or indirectly make any inducement, threat or promise to any person, acquainted with the facts of this case;

